Changes
=======

v4.0.4 24 July 2026
  * Bump `github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4` to v4.2.0.

v4.0.3 1 July 2026
  * Bump `github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4` to v4.1.0.

v4.0.2 7 May 2026
  * Adopt v4 `RegisterKeyImporter` signature: now takes
    `KeyImporter[T]` rather than a typed function, matching the
    interface-plus-FooFunc-adapter pattern used elsewhere in
    jwx's `jwk` extension surface.
  * Bump `github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4` to v4.0.2.

v4.0.1 28 Apr 2026
  * Strict JWK validation in `extractPrivateKey` / `extractPublicKey`:
    enforce that the JWK `alg` matches the requested ML-DSA parameter
    set, and that the embedded public key matches the seed-derived
    public key on the private-key path.

v4.0.0 19 Apr 2026
  * First stable v4 release. Tracks github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4 v4.0.0.
  * `dsig.SignerWithOpts` / `dsig.VerifierWithOpts` now reject a non-nil
    `crypto.SignerOpts` whose concrete type is not `*mldsa.Options`.
    Previously such opts were silently coerced to nil and the operation
    proceeded with `ctx=""`, which is a signature-substitution vector for
    callers (notably `github.com/jwx-go/compsig/v4`) that rely on the
    `Context` field for domain separation.

v4.0.0-alpha3 13 Apr 2026
  * Implement `dsig.SignerWithOpts` / `dsig.VerifierWithOpts` on
    `mldsaDsigAlgorithm`, forwarding `*mldsa.Options.Context` to
    `filippo.io/mldsa`. This lets composite ML-DSA callers (notably
    `github.com/jwx-go/compsig/v4`) supply the per-algorithm
    domain-separation context that `draft-ietf-jose-pq-composite-sigs`
    §4.2 step 3 requires, without bypassing the `dsig` dispatcher.

  * Bump `github.com/lestrrat-go/dsig` from v1.2.1 to v1.3.0 (which
    introduced the `SignerWithOpts` / `VerifierWithOpts` interfaces).

v4.0.0-alpha2 13 Apr 2026
  * Compatibility release for jwx/v4 v4.0.0-scratch.15. No code changes.

v4.0.0-alpha1 8 Apr 2026
  * Initial version, ML-DSA (FIPS 204) support for github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4.
